{
  "_TODO_BOOTSTRAP_NOTES": [
    "REPLACE the enum values below with your field's vocabulary.",
    "research_domain: 5-10 sub-areas of your field.",
    "document_type: usually keep universal (research-article, review, perspective, ...).",
    "recommended_template: MUST list every templates/<id>.txt file in this pack.",
    "primary_reaction / primary_system: rename these field names AND their content",
